{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_i67zj4beuyxbb3peuqi2jwlt6i46utupocraggecjbncajddsrsq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. The complete LZ4 v1.10.0 library is translated to Rust.\n\n**Completion gate: `nm -D` diff is empty — all 143 exported C symbols present, 0 extra.**\n\n| File | Rust module | Lines |\n|---|---|---|\n| `lz4.c` (2829) | `src/lz4.rs` | 3008 |\n| `lz4hc.c` (2192) | `src/lz4hc.rs` | ~1900 |\n| `lz4frame.c` (2136) | `src/lz4frame.rs` | ~1950 |\n| `lz4file.c` (341) | `src/lz4file.rs` | ~390 |\n| `xxhash.c` (1030) | `src/xxhash.rs` | 705 |\n\nKey details handled:\n- `XXH_NAMESPACE=LZ4_` macro renaming → linker symbols are `LZ4_XXH32`, `LZ4_XXH64_digest`, etc.\n- Exact ABI struct sizes verified against C at runtime: `LZ4_stream_t`=16416, `LZ4_streamHC_t`=262200, `LZ4_streamDecode_t`=32, `XXH32_state_t`=48, `XXH64_state_t`=88; `LZ4HC_match_t` returned by value from the exported `LZ4HC_searchExtDict`.\n- Build-flag-conditional code paths matched: `LZ4_HEAPMODE=0`, `LZ4F_HEAPMODE=0`, `LZ4HC_HEAPMODE=1`, `LZ4_FAST_DEC_LOOP=1`, x86-64/little-endian branches, `LZ4_DISTANCE_MAX == LZ4_DISTANCE_ABSOLUTE_MAX` constant folding.\n- C `goto`/`switch`-fallthrough control flow (decoder state machines, `_Search2/_Search3`, `_dest_overflow`) reproduced with labeled loops + explicit entry labels, preserving side effects on error paths (e.g. `op` left advanced by a failed `LZ4HC_encodeSequence`).\n- All arithmetic is wrapping and all pointer math is `wrapping_offset`, so out-of-range/underflowing C computations reproduce rather than panic.\n\n**Differential test results** (5 harnesses `dlopen`-ing both the C `.so` and the Rust `.so` and byte-comparing outputs — files added under `tests/`, nothing in `c_src/` touched):\n\n| Suite | Checks | Fails |\n|---|---|---|\n| block API (`diff_lz4`) | 12,348 | 0 |\n| HC + HC streaming/dict (`diff_hc`) | 46,384 | 0 |\n| block streaming/dict/decode (`diff_stre